B.c2h=new A.fP(B.oz,"Exam Countdown Widget for Your Course","Stay locked in on your academic dreams with a live daily countdown timer dynamically tailored to your course (UPSC, MPSC, NEET, JEE, GATE, Banking, etc.).","Focus Radar","timer","/student/home","Check Countdown")
B.c2i=new A.fP(B.Hu,"10-Second Express Counter Billing & Atomic Seat Parity","Lightning-fast cash payment recording with instant digital receipts and zero-drift concurrency safety ensuring double-seat allocations are completely prevented.","Billing & Parity","point_of_sale","/admin/home","Collect Fee")
B.c2j=new A.fP(B.kV,"Silent Reception & Noise Help Button","Study in complete peace. Discreetly alert reception about noise, AC temperature, Wi-Fi issues, or desk hygiene without leaving your seat or causing a disturbance.","Quiet Study","volume_off","/student/feedback","Explore Help Desk")
