B.c2w=new A.fP(B.un,"Anti-Fraud UTR Replay Defense & AC Power Surcharge","Automated bank/UPI UTR duplicate detection across payments preventing screenshot reuse, dedicated high-wattage power amenity toggle, and dynamic custom field regex validation.","Anti-Fraud & Ledger","shield","/admin/home","Collect Fee")
